Consider a piecewise stationary bandit environment with minimum change-gap $\underline{\Delta
}_{\mrm{c}}$. Furthermore, consider a DAB procedure (Procedure~\ref{alg:DAB}) using a change detector $\mcal{D}$ with parameters \textup{$\delta_{\mrm{F}}$ and $\delta_{\mrm{D}}$}, stationary bandit algorithm $\mcal{B}$ (with suboptimality gap upper bound $C$), and forced exploration frequencies $\lp \alpha_{k} \rp_{k = 1}^{N_{T} + 1}$
Suppose further that the following condition holds:
\begin{equation} \label{eq:cond1}
d_{k - 1} + m_{k} \leq \nu_{k} - \nu_{k - 1}, ~\emph{for~all~} k \in [N_T]
\end{equation}
